<title>PORTUGAL: BPI block trade a temporary move -sources.</title>
<headline>BPI block trade a temporary move -sources.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 430,000-share block trade in Banco Portugues de Investimento SA stock on Wednesday was a special operation to raise funds for a Portuguese investor with the stock as guarantee, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is just a financing operation,&quot; said one trader who asked not to be identified. Officials at BPI could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>Overall, 579,801 shares in BPI, equal to about one percent of its capital, were traded on Wednesday with the price easing one escudo to 1,804.</p>
<p>--Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
